  "notes": "{頼|たよ}る means to rely on, depend on, or turn to someone/something for help or support.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Takes に particle: Xに{頼|たよ}る (to rely on X)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {親|おや}に{頼|たよ}る: to rely on one's parents\n- {辞書|じしょ}に{頼|たよ}る: to depend on a dictionary\n- {人|ひと}に{頼|たよ}らない: not relying on others\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {頼|たよ}り: reliance, dependence; news, word from someone\n- {頼|たよ}りになる: to be reliable/dependable\n- {頼|たの}む: to request, ask (different reading, transitive)\n\nNUANCE:\nOften implies needing help or support, can have a slightly dependent connotation.",
